{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_8","type":"agent_message","text":"The randomly selected title is **Demon Rumble**. The game will be a front-facing, 2.5D arena shooter: demons split into diving offspring, destroyed formations drop weapon boosts, and a final boss brings the mechanics together. I’m building the art from shaded geometry and ink outlines, with all audio synthesized in code."}}
