and corrected. Built combat, input, menus, synthesis and networking. Hardest: coordinating physics, rendering and replicated state. Engine changes: none. Desired improvement: consistent built-in toon shading and outlines across rendering backends.\n\n**Prompt Feedback:** Liked the concrete controller-first and attract-mode requirements. Multiplayer topology and campaign duration were unclear. Hardest: completing and verifying every input method and multiplayer flow. Suggested change: specify campaign duration and whether relay-backed connectivity is required."}}
